Since Django 6.0.6 isn't published yet, I implemented the template partials feature using custom template tags (`{% partial card %}...{% endpartial %}` to define, `{% use_partial card %}` to render) registered as builtins on a standalone `Engine`. The card markup is written once in the template and reused for both lists. `render_card(item)` extracts the named partial's nodelist from the compiled template and renders it independently.
